In Trilok Chand Bansal Vs. Bharat Bhushan Bansal, CS(OS) 470/2016,
Date of Decision - 23.03.2017, it was held by Hon'ble High Court of Delhi that the tort of malicious prosecution require proof of the existence of following four elements:
a. Initiation or continuation of a law suit;
 b. Favourable termination of law suit;
 c. Lack of probable cause; and  d. Malice.
